- `guard(b1, n3, ...), guard(b1, n4, ...), guard(b2, n7, ...), guard(b2, n8, ...)`: Missing guard statements for branches `b1` and `b2`. The source explicitly dictates conditional routing (“If there is no fee.../if there is a fee...”, “If it is approved.../if rejected...”), but the model omits the required guards to constrain the XOR splits, violating SMC1 and SMC4.
